## Things this licence does not cover

**Structural data.** Coordinates fetched from the RCSB PDB are not ours to license. PDB entries are
in the public domain, but cite the original depositors — the entry IDs and fetch dates are in the
scripts that use them.

**Model weights.** Nothing here redistributes model weights. The models named in `docs/themes.md`
carry their own licences, and at least one set of MLIP weights is non-commercial. Check before you
build on them.

**Brand assets.** The University of Auckland and Waipapa Taumata Rau marks in `outreach/brand/`, and
the Open Scientific Intelligence Hackathon wordmark, belong to their owners and are used here by
permission for this event. They are not covered by CC BY 4.0 and should not be reused.
